# Observation-only peer-locality diagnostics for C2P oracle replays.
#
# This switch must be used with the `oracle` mode only.  In baseline mode the
# L1 detect hook is deliberately inactive, so a matched baseline remains a
# pure no-observation control.  The diagnostic never changes cache state,
# lower routing, queue admission, or latency.
-c2p_cache_peer_locality_diagnostic 1
